Trip history by profile_id (CUSTOMER or DRIVER):
curl -i "http://localhost:8080/api/trips/history?profile_id=7&limit=20&offset=0"
Returns completed/cancelled trips in descending trip_id order, with data, has_more, limit and offset.

Current trip assigned to a driver (ACCEPTED or GOING):
curl -i "http://localhost:8080/api/driver/trips/active?driver_id=6"
Returns the active trip in data, or data: null when no trip is assigned.

GetRole: curl -i http://localhost:8080/api/getRoles
GetALLDriver: curl -i http://localhost:8080/api/admin/drivers
GetALLRequestDriver: curl -i http://localhost:8080/api/admin/drivers/requests

Approved Driver :
curl -i -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/drivers/1/approve \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d '{"driver_id": 2, "status": true, "reason": ""}'

Reject Driver:
curl -i -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/drivers/1/approve \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d '{"driver_id": 2, "status": false, "reason": "Ảnh mặt sau của Căn cước công dân bị mờ, không nhìn rõ số"}'

